  "description": "FsMath is a lightweight maths library designed for modern F# workflows. It focuses on zero-friction interop with existing array-centric libraries ( FSharp.Stats, Math.NET Numerics, libtorch via TorchSharp, etc.) while giving you the performance head-room of SIMD-accelerated kernels and a clean, idiomatic F# API.",
